- **Parity log** enumerating all 74 items with file:symbol evidence (`PARITY_COVERED=74`).

**Parity (74):** 22 panels (8-panel live flow schematic with SoC `TSRadialGauge` + flow arrows; 6 summary cards; 2 daily charts; 3-card efficiency panel; history table), 4 charts (RadialGauge/Area/Bar/Bar via P3 wrappers), 4 states (loading/empty/error/success per source), 44 strings. Live `/energy/flow` polled with a >2-min staleness guard (ADR-013); SI converted at the render boundary via `Units` (ADR-005).

