- macOS app **whole-module type-check (EmitSwiftModule): 0 diagnostics**; **0 `error:` lines across the entire build log**, 0 crashes. The one real issue the build caught — `EnergyFlowNode`/`EnergyFlowArrow` colliding with pre-existing widget structs — was found and fixed (renamed to `EnergyFlowDiagram*`), then re-verified clean.

